  "description": "Jo Seongwu is college basketball's biggest star, and Wonse University's ace, with his sights set on the big league. He's got talent to spare and an ego to match. Kang Seolhyun has idolized him from the bench. A late starter with no flashy résumé or standout build, he makes up for it with relentless grit and a deadly shooting touch. When starting guard Sihun goes down with an injury, Seolhyun finally gets his shot, right alongside the arrogant star he's always admired...\n\n(Source: Lezhin Entertainment)",
